message: "If you use this atlas or its derived dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Rural Cardiology Desert Atlas"
abstract: >
  Versioned open-source research and planning atlas of adult-cardiology
  access across the exact 3,144-county 2025 Census universe. The release
  combines qualifying CMS NPPES records, CMS hospital and Critical Access
  Hospital data, controlled Census and HUD-USPS geography, ACS demographics,
  CDC PLACES coronary-heart-disease prevalence, USDA RUCC, and HRSA HPSA data.
  Counts describe qualifying NPPES-listed mapped locations and do not measure
  verified availability, full-time equivalents, appointment capacity,
  telehealth coverage, quality, or outcomes.
